### ============================================
### PARKING LOTS - Alle endpoints
### ============================================
### Deze file bevat alle endpoints voor parkeerplaatsen.
### Zorg dat je eerst ingelogd bent (auth.rest) om een token te hebben.
### ============================================

### VARIABELEN
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5082
@contentType = application/json

### TOKEN - Vul dit in na login (kopieer uit auth.rest response)
@token = YOUR_TOKEN_HIER
@adminToken = YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HIER

### ============================================
### GET ENDPOINTS
### ============================================

### 1. GET ALL - Haal alle parkeerplaatsen op (AllowAnonymous)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/parking-lots
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 2. GET ALL - Met sorting (name, location, capacity, available)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/parking-lots?sortBy=name&order=asc
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 3. GET ALL - Sorteer op capaciteit (descending)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/parking-lots?sortBy=capacity&order=desc
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 4. GET BY ID - Haal specifieke parkeerplaats op (AllowAnonymous)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/parking-lots/1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 5. GET SESSIONS - Haal alle sessions van een parkeerplaats op (Authorize)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/parking-lots/1/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 6. GET SESSIONS - Alleen actieve sessions (Authorize)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/parking-lots/1/sessions?activeOnly=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### ============================================
### POST ENDPOINTS - SESSIONS
### ============================================

### 7. START SESSION - Start een parkeersessie (Authorize: User/Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/parking-lots/1/sessions/start
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..4w4-k52OZFXs0aZ_BUMEgfis8IorGWcaiaF4dtGlUjQ
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "licensePlate": "AB-12-CD"
}

### 8. STOP SESSION - Stop een parkeersessie (Authorize: User/Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/parking-lots/1/sessions/stop
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "licensePlate": "AB-12-CD"
}

### ============================================
### POST ENDPOINTS - CREATE (Admin Only)
### ============================================

### 9. CREATE PARKING LOT - Maak nieuwe parkeerplaats aan (Authorize: Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/parking-lots
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Centrum Parking",
  "location": "Amsterdam Centrum",
  "address": "Damrak 1, 1012 LG Amsterdam",
  "capacity": 200,
  "reserved": 20,
  "tariff": 3.50,
  "dayTariff": 25.00,
  "lat": 52.3676,
  "lng": 4.9041
}

### ============================================
### PUT ENDPOINTS - UPDATE (Admin Only)
### ============================================

### 10. UPDATE PARKING LOT - Update parkeerplaats (Authorize: Admin)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/parking-lots/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Centrum Parking Updated",
  "location": "Amsterdam Centrum",
  "address": "Damrak 1, 1012 LG Amsterdam",
  "capacity": 250,
  "reserved": 25,
  "tariff": 4.00,
  "dayTariff": 30.00,
  "lat": 52.3676,
  "lng": 4.9041
}

### ============================================
### DELETE ENDPOINTS (Admin Only)
### ============================================

### 11. DELETE PARKING LOT - Verwijder parkeerplaats (Authorize: Admin)
### Let op: Kan alleen verwijderd worden als er geen actieve sessions zijn
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/parking-lots/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### ============================================
### TEST SCENARIOS
### ============================================

